    E("Custom Material###Custom Material", "", "", "", "", "", "自定义材质###Custom Material"),
    E("Import an aerofoil section (Selig or Lednicer coordinates from airfoiltools.com): pick the file, set the chord in the popup, tap to place the leading edge.", "", "", "", "", "", "导入翼型截面（Selig 或 Lednicer 坐标，来自 airfoiltools.com）：选择文件，在弹窗中设置弦长，点击放置前缘。"),
    E("Import an aerofoil section (Selig or Lednicer coordinates, e.g. from airfoiltools.com): pick the file, set the chord in the popup, click to place the leading edge. Stack sections on planes and Loft for a wing.", "", "", "", "", "", "导入翼型截面（Selig 或 Lednicer 坐标，例如来自 airfoiltools.com）：选择文件，在弹窗中设置弦长，点击放置前缘。将截面堆叠在平面上并放样即可生成机翼。"),
    E("Orbit##touchSens", "", "", "", "", "", "旋转视图##touchSens"),
    E("Pan##touchSens", "", "", "", "", "", "平移##touchSens"),
    E("The section's own trailing edge has thickness, which is what you want for a printed or machined part; a knife edge cannot be manufactured.", "", "", "", "", "", "截面的后缘本身有厚度，这正是打印或机加工零件所需要的；刃口是无法制造的。"),
    E("Zoom##touchSens", "", "", "", "", "", "缩放##touchSens"),
    E("deg##tw", "", "", "", "", "", "度##tw"),
    E("Navigating the viewport", "", "", "", "", "", "浏览视口"),
    E("Drag the middle mouse button to orbit, the right button to pan, and the scroll wheel to zoom. The cube in the top-right is a navigation widget: click a face for an orthographic view, click a corner dot for an isometric view, click an arrow for a 90° rotation, or drag the cube itself to free-orbit. Reset the camera with Home or View → Reset Camera.", "", "", "", "", "", "拖动鼠标中键旋转视图，右键平移，滚轮缩放。右上角的立方体是导航控件：点击面切换到正交视图，点击角点切换到等轴测视图，点击箭头进行 90° 旋转，或拖动立方体本身自由旋转。按 Home 或通过视图 → 重置相机复位相机。"),
    E("Selecting things", "", "", "", "", "", "选择对象"),
    E("Single-click a face or edge to select it; Ctrl+click adds to the selection. Double-click selects the whole body. Drag in empty space to box-select multiple bodies at once. Esc clears or cancels the current operation.", "", "", "", "", "", "单击面或边进行选择；Ctrl+点击添加到选择。双击选择整个实体。在空白处拖拽可一次框选多个实体。Esc 清除或取消当前操作。"),
    E("Sketching", "", "", "", "", "", "绘制草图"),
    E("Pick Sketch on XY/XZ/YZ from the Tools panel (or Sketch on Face after selecting one), then choose a tool: Line, Rectangle, Circle, Arc, Spline, Polygon, or Trim. Type a numeric dimension while placing to lock the size. Press D for the Dimension tool: click a line, circle, two points, or two lines (parallel = distance, angled = angle), click to place the label, then type the value. Switch to Select / Move to drag existing points and lines — double-click empties to select the whole sketch, then use Copy / Mirror / Rotate. Click Finish Sketch (or press Enter) to exit.", "", "", "", "", "", "从工具面板选择在 XY/XZ/YZ 上绘制草图（或在选中面后选择在面上草图），然后选择工具：直线、矩形、圆、圆弧、样条、多边形或修剪。放置时输入数值尺寸以锁定大小。按 D 使用标注工具：点击直线、圆、两个点或两条线（平行 = 距离，有角度 = 角度），点击放置标签，然后输入数值。切换到选择 / 移动可拖动现有点和线 — 双击空白处选择整个草图，然后使用复制 / 镜像 / 旋转。点击完成草图（或按回车）退出。"),
    E("Modelling from a sketch", "", "", "", "", "", "从草图建模"),
    E("With a sketch region or face selected, click Extrude or Push/Pull. An arrow gizmo appears on the face — drag it for live preview, or type a value in the popup. Negative values cut into the body. After you have a body, use Fillet or Chamfer on edges (drag the handle outward to grow the radius/distance) and Mirror / Pattern from the tools sidebar.", "", "", "", "", "", "选中草图区域或面后，点击拉伸或推拉。面上会出现箭头控件 — 拖动进行实时预览，或在弹窗中输入数值。负值会切入实体。有了实体后，对边使用圆角或倒角（向外拖动手柄以增大半径/距离），并从工具侧栏使用镜像 / 阵列。"),
    E("Select a body (or several) and pick the Move, Rotate or Scale gizmo from the toolbar. Drag a handle to transform. Rotate snaps softly to 45°; Scale snaps to 1%% and shows a live readout. Scale has a side panel for typed per-axis values and a uniform-scale checkbox.", "", "", "", "", "", "选择一个（或多个）实体，并从工具栏选择移动、旋转或缩放控件。拖动控制柄进行变换。旋转软吸附到 45°；缩放吸附到 1%% 并显示实时读数。缩放有一个侧面板，用于输入各轴数值和均匀缩放复选框。"),
    E("Every modelling step goes into History on the right. Click a step to edit its parameters in Properties; right-click for Delete, Disable, Set Breakpoint, or Edit. Click a fillet/chamfer face in the viewport to jump straight to its history step. Reloaded projects show steps marked (reloaded) — undo/redo still walks through them but their parameters can't be re-edited.", "", "", "", "", "", "每个建模步骤都会进入右侧的历史记录。点击步骤可在属性中编辑其参数；右键可删除、禁用、设置断点或编辑。点击视口中的圆角/倒角面可直接跳转到其历史步骤。重新加载的项目会显示标记为（已重新加载）的步骤 — 撤销/重做仍可遍历它们，但其参数无法重新编辑。"),
    E("Saving and autosave", "", "", "", "", "", "保存与自动保存"),
    E("Ctrl+S saves; the project includes bodies, colours, sketches and the operation history. Settings → Autosave enables a periodic re-save once the project has a file on disk. Application preferences (theme, mouse buttons, orbit mode) are stored separately under your user config directory so they follow you between projects.", "", "", "", "", "", "Ctrl+S 保存；项目包含实体、颜色、草图和操作历史。设置 → 自动保存可在项目在磁盘上有文件后启用定期重新保存。应用偏好设置（主题、鼠标按钮、旋转模式）单独存储在你的用户配置目录下，以便跟随你在不同项目间使用。"),
    E("Desktop-style. A menu bar on top and every panel visible at once. Best with a mouse and keyboard.", "", "", "", "", "", "桌面风格。顶部有菜单栏，所有面板同时可见。最适合鼠标和键盘。"),
